1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,990
In this town, nobody is allowed to
look outside at exactly 2:17 AM.

2
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:05,656
Nobody knows who made the rule.

3
00:00:05,656 --> 00:00:06,785
Nobody ever explains why.

4
00:00:06,785 --> 00:00:08,895
At 2:16, every curtain closes.

5
00:00:08,895 --> 00:00:10,232
And every light goes out.

6
00:00:10,382 --> 00:00:11,196
My name is Alex.

7
00:00:11,196 --> 00:00:13,677
And I always thought it was just a
story to scare kids.

8
00:00:13,677 --> 00:00:14,682
Until last night.

9
00:00:14,682 --> 00:00:15,857
I was almost asleep...

10
00:00:15,857 --> 00:00:16,786
when I heard it.

11
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,484
Three knocks.

12
00:00:19,484 --> 00:00:20,490
On my window.

13
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,346
I checked the clock.

14
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,186
2:17

15
00:00:24,186 --> 00:00:24,472
AM.

16
00:00:24,672 --> 00:00:26,285
Then I heard my mom's voice.

17
00:00:26,285 --> 00:00:27,033
From outside.

18
00:00:27,183 --> 00:00:27,983
Alex...

19
00:00:27,983 --> 00:00:28,908
please...

20
00:00:28,908 --> 00:00:29,973
let me in.

21
00:00:30,273 --> 00:00:30,933
I looked.

22
00:00:30,933 --> 00:00:32,383
She was standing in the yard.

23
00:00:32,383 --> 00:00:33,346
Smiling.

24
00:00:33,346 --> 00:00:34,083
Same sweater.

25
00:00:34,083 --> 00:00:34,943
Same smile.

26
00:00:34,943 --> 00:00:36,158
But she didn't blink.

27
00:00:36,158 --> 00:00:36,953
Not once.

28
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:38,525
Then a hand grabbed my shoulder.

29
00:00:38,525 --> 00:00:40,245
My real mom was standing behind me.

30
00:00:40,345 --> 00:00:42,305
Don't look at her.

31
00:00:42,455 --> 00:00:43,175
I turned back.

32
00:00:43,175 --> 00:00:44,386
But she was still there.

33
00:00:44,386 --> 00:00:46,011
The next morning, I looked outside.

34
00:00:46,011 --> 00:00:48,956
In front of every single house,
someone was standing.

35
00:00:48,956 --> 00:00:50,720
Staring into the windows.

36
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,126
And every single one of them...

37
00:00:52,126 --> 00:00:53,411
looked terrified.

38
00:00:54,161 --> 00:00:56,291
The rule was never protecting us from
them.

39
00:00:56,291 --> 00:00:57,631
It was protecting them...

40
00:00:57,631 --> 00:00:58,466
from us.

